Usage: narrac [flags] <command>

The Narra compiler.

Flags:
  -v, --verbose  print each step
  -h, --help     print this help

Commands:
  build    Build a program.
  run      Build and run a program.
  version

Usage: narrac build [flags] <file>

Build a program.

Flags:
      --release           build with optimizations
  -o, --output <path>     where to write the binary
      --filter <name>...  keep matching tests
  -q, --quiet
  -h, --help              print this help

Usage: narrac run [flags] <file> [arguments...]

Build and run a program.

Flags:
  -h, --help  print this help

